// Hot batch 309: ninety-four to ninety-eight-instruction functions no route reaches, written by hand from `tools.disasm`
// and verified by synthetic cases (script bindings and bridges, a child-state machine, stat counters, a name-match
// counter, a request dispatcher and a one-time event setup).
// No names: none has evidence.
